<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 215px;" id="mwAwk"><div class="thumb" style="width: 210px; height: 210px;" id="mwAwo"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwAws"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Weathered_sandstone,_Sedona.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="Permian sandstone wall near Sedona, Arizona, United States, weathered into a small alcove" id="mwAww"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Weathered_sandstone,_Sedona.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Weathered_sandstone%2C_Sedona.jpg/250px-Weathered_sandstone%2C_Sedona.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Weathered_sandstone%2C_Sedona.jpg/500px-Weathered_sandstone%2C_Sedona.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Permian sandstone wall near Sedona, Arizona, United States, weathered into a small alcove" data-file-width="3872" data-file-height="2592" data-file-type="bitmap" height="120" width="180" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAw0"/></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwAw4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Permian" title="Permian" id="mwAw8">Permian</a> sandstone wall near <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sedona,_Arizona" title="Sedona, Arizona" id="mwAxA">Sedona, Arizona</a>, United States, weathered into a small <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alcove_(landform)" title="Alcove (landform)" id="mwAxE">alcove</a></div></li>
<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 215px;" id="mwAxI"><div class="thumb" style="width: 210px; height: 210px;" id="mwAxM"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwAxQ"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Weathered_sandstone_DSC01497.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="Weathering on a sandstone pillar in Bayreuth" id="mwAxU"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Weathered_sandstone_DSC01497.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Weathered_sandstone_DSC01497.jpg/250px-Weathered_sandstone_DSC01497.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Weathered_sandstone_DSC01497.jpg/500px-Weathered_sandstone_DSC01497.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Weathering on a sandstone pillar in Bayreuth" data-file-width="5082" data-file-height="3648" data-file-type="bitmap" height="129" width="180" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAxY"/></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwAxc">Weathering on a sandstone pillar in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayreuth" title="Bayreuth" id="mwAxg">Bayreuth</a></div></li>
